WEBVTT

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:01.760
Ni mpango wa piramidi,
unataka nini, unauza nini?"

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:06.816
Lakini watu wengi walipata mguso wa
kushangaza.

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:10.616
Nakumbuka, nilimpigia mwanamke
anaedhibiti wadudu

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:13.816
kwenye ghala
ambapo kahawa yangu inatumiwa --

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:16.416
samahani -- ambapo kahawa yangu inatunzwa.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.896
Na nikasema,

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:20.416
"Hii inaweza kusikika kiajabu,

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:24.816
lakini nataka kukushukuru
kwa kuondoa wadudu kwenye kahawa yangu."

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.456
Na akasema, "Kweli,
hio inasikika kiajabu,

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.576
lakini umefanya siku yangu kuwa nzuri."

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:33.176
Na ilikua kama tofauti ya simu za
udanganyifu.